    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="a3f8514c-898e-52eb-b53e-5af24de56e17" activityNameId="0d25cfe4-e5a9-5cb8-a419-9fb0f9dfacc7" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Lithium manganese oxide, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Lithium manganese oxide, at plant
The dataset can be used for preparing electrode material for batteries. Data are based on patents. For infrastructure, the ecoinvent dataset "chemical plant, organics" is accounted. Transportation efforts are based on ecoinvent standard estimates.;
Formula: LiMn2O4; 
Synonyms: Lithium manganese(III,IV) oxide; Lithium manganese oxide, spinel type; 
UUID: 619a5d81-ba7c-39b7-9ae0-e1652984cf50
This dataset includes rosting of manganese oxide and lithium carbonate in a inert  atmosphere in a rotary kiln, followed by spray drying and roasting again in a oxidising  atmosphere in a rotary kiln. Energy consumption and CO2 emissions to air are calculated
Location: Some Swiss or  European datasets are used for global processes.
Technology: This dataset includes a method of producing lithium manganese oxide out of manganese oxide and lithium carbonate by 2 rosting processes in inert atmosphere, followed by spray drying of a suspension and roasting again in a oxidising atmosphere in a rotary kiln.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: patent, website, ecoinvent 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: Uncertainty is assessed using the pedigree matrix.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_619a5d81-ba7c-39b7-9ae0-e1652984cf50.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
